{"Name": "document3", "Natural": "Here is a summarized version of the text, keeping only the most important information:\n\n**Young Sheldon**\n\n* American television sitcom (2017-2024)\n* Prequel to The Big Bang Theory\n* Developed by Chuck Lorre and Steven Molaro\n* Premiered on CBS on November 2, 2017\n\n**Cast**\n\n* Iain Armitage as Sheldon Cooper\n* Zoe Perry as Mary Cooper\n* Lance Barber as George Cooper Sr.\n* Montana Jordan as George Cooper Jr.\n* Raegan Revord as Melissa \"Missy\" Cooper\n* Annie Potts as Constance \"Meemaw\" Tucker\n\n**Synopsis**\n\n* The series follows Sheldon Cooper's early life as a child prodigy in Medford, Texas\n* It explores his relationships with his family and friends, and his struggles to fit in\n\n**Reception**\n\n* Critical acclaim, with a 76% approval rating on Rotten Tomatoes\n* Metacritic score of 63 out of 100\n* Won several awards, including the ReFrame Stamp for gender-balanced hiring\n\n**Spin-off series**\n\n* Georgie & Mandy's First Marriage, a spin-off series focusing on Georgie Cooper and Mandy McAllister, is in development\n*"}
